// Quasar theme variables — override your branding here.
//
// These six values are the ONLY place your admin's colours are decided.
// SaaSiCat has no palette of its own for them: `--sa-color-accent` and the four
// status roles read Quasar's `--q-*` variables, which Quasar publishes from
// exactly these SCSS variables. Change `$primary` and the hero, the buttons,
// the focus ring, the tinted surfaces, Quasar's own components and the
// tenant-facing pages all follow — there is no second switch.
//
// The defaults are SaaSiCat's own, so a freshly scaffolded admin looks like the
// documentation until you decide otherwise.
$primary: #3f6bff;
$secondary: #475569;
$accent: #0ea5e9;

$positive: #047857;
$negative: #dc2626;
$warning: #b45309;
$info: #2563eb;
